    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>::::::::::::::::::::|\u00a0 GOAL OF THE GAME |::::::::::::::::::::</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create a Build around a strategy that works for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summon your Monsters and Roll to grow your assault!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play strategically to finally Destroy your Rival's Gem Master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::|\u00a0 Builds\u00a0 |::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create your Build to use against your Rival!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Builds are a mix of Monsters and Dice!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With over +1000 combinations, there's no telling what kind strategy you could make!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Save Builds to use at any time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Share Builds with other Players!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the same Build for both Players for a mirror-match! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330670/extras/01243d1cdc654be18e70054be229ea7f.poster.avif?t=1753961929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330670/extras/01243d1cdc654be18e70054be229ea7f.webm?t=1753961929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330670/extras/01243d1cdc654be18e70054be229ea7f.mp4?t=1753961929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::|\u00a0 Dice Rolls!\u00a0 |:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roll your Dice to collect GRIT!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick your Dice to Roll for a chance to get what you need!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ATTACK GRIT</strong> for Combat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MOVE GRIT</strong> for moving Monsters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FOCUS GRIT</strong> to use Monster Abilities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GEM GRIT</strong> to Summon Monsters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TILE GRIT</strong> to grow your Path!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330670/extras/3f48f32701a574cff2601328b1271f52.poster.avif?t=1753961929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330670/extras/3f48f32701a574cff2601328b1271f52.webm?t=1753961929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330670/extras/3f48f32701a574cff2601328b1271f52.mp4?t=1753961929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::|\u00a0 Tile Paths\u00a0 |::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build a Path to move your Monsters!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The further your Path, the closer you can Summon Monsters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place Tiles strategically to block your Rival!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use Monster Abilities to punish your Rival's Tile Placement ! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330670/extras/bb479df73a25100d38ca39280a4c045e.poster.avif?t=1753961929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330670/extras/bb479df73a25100d38ca39280a4c045e.webm?t=1753961929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330670/extras/bb479df73a25100d38ca39280a4c045e.mp4?t=1753961929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::|\u00a0 Abilities\u00a0 |::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every Monster has an Ability, so why not use it?!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buff your own Monsters with Abilities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use Ailments to debuff your Rival's Monsters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're in a pinch, Abilities can completely turn the game around! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330670/extras/dacbcfd06f8e8d757301290a2eb2958a.poster.avif?t=1753961929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330670/extras/dacbcfd06f8e8d757301290a2eb2958a.webm?t=1753961929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330670/extras/dacbcfd06f8e8d757301290a2eb2958a.mp4?t=1753961929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::|\u00a0 Attack and Destroy\u00a0 |:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Move your Monsters to Attack and Defeat your Rival!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Unique Combat allows both the Attacker and Defender to deal Damage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you don't build to Defend or Attack, then you may succumb to Combat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no limit to your total Summons, so you are able to keep sending out fodder!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you defeat your Rival's Gem Master, then you Win! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330670/extras/4744cf49dbf05c6364f8923e3f3aa26e.poster.avif?t=1753961929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330670/extras/4744cf49dbf05c6364f8923e3f3aa26e.webm?t=1753961929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330670/extras/4744cf49dbf05c6364f8923e3f3aa26e.mp4?t=1753961929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
