paragraph\">The Unique Combat allows both the Attacker and Defender to deal Damage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you don't build to Defend or Attack, then you may succumb to Combat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no limit to your total Summons, so you are able to keep sending out fodder!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you defeat your Rival's Gem Master, then you Win! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330670/extras/4744cf49dbf05c6364f8923e3f3aa26e.poster.avif?t=1753961929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330670/extras/4744cf49dbf05c6364f8923e3f3aa26e.webm?t=1753961929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330670/extras/4744cf49dbf05c6364f8923e3f3aa26e.mp4?t=1753961929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
